SSTTAANNDDAARRDDSS
     The ffwwssccaannff(), wwssccaannff(), sswwssccaannff(), vvffwwssccaannff(), vvwwssccaannff() and vvsswwssccaannff()
     functions conform to ISO/IEC 9899:1999 (“ISO C99”).

BBUUGGSS
     In addition to the bugs documented in scanf(3), wwssccaannff() does not support
     the “A-Z” notation for specifying character ranges with the character
     class conversion (‘%%[[’).

